Do not log sensitive conversation contents or complete alternatives merely to produce these metrics.

Benchmark at least:

- Initial upload of 100 MPNs.
- A follow-up involving one cached MPN.
- A comparison involving multiple cached MPNs.
- A mixed cache-hit/cache-miss request.
- A follow-up after cache expiry.

Compare results against the current implementation. Report measured changes rather than claiming latency improvements without measurements.

